story += [H('5.1 Dataset and split organisation'),P('SOCOFing contains original fingerprints and synthetic alterations [8]. The project metadata uses subject_id, hand and finger to form class_id, so two different fingers of one person are different classes. The local processed data contain 55,270 images. A subject-disjoint split check found no overlap between the test subjects and either training or validation subjects. This reduces subject leakage between splits but does not establish independence between altered and original images of a single test finger.'),]
