story += [PageBreak(),Paragraph('Appendix A: Reproducibility and submission checklist',styles['ChapterX']),P('The EER comparison is produced by python -m src.training.compare_eer. It writes comparison.csv, test_pairs.csv, per-checkpoint JSON reports and pair-score CSVs under outputs/eer_comparison. The retrieval study is produced by python -m src.retrieval.person_evaluation and writes person_scores.csv, query_results.csv and summary.json under outputs/person_evaluation/densenet121_arcface. These commands require the local dataset, checkpoints and, for retrieval, access to the Pinecone namespaces.'),P('Before academic submission, replace the marked student names, registration numbers, degree, programme, institution, department, guide, date and signatures. Confirm dataset usage terms and institutional rules. Verify current cloud upload completion, namespace access and the experimental files independently. Add an actual screenshot only after visually inspecting the working application and label it as such. Update any formatting mandated by the institution.'),Paragraph('Appendix B: Suggested further evaluation table',styles['SectionX'])]
